---
---
<section class="features" id="keunggulan">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up">
      <div class="badge-mini">Keunggulan Utama</div>
      <h2>Mengapa Memilih <span class="text-gradient">Tahseena?</span></h2>
      <p>Standar bimbingan terbaik dengan menggabungkan kearifan metode tradisional dan kenyamanan teknologi modern.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="feature-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"></circle><polyline points="17 11 19 13 23 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Pembimbing Bersanad</h3>
        <p>Bimbingan langsung dari ahli yang memiliki sanad resmi untuk menjamin kualitas bacaan.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="feature-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Metode Talaqqi</h3>
        <p>Sistem belajar private face-to-face untuk memastikan ketepatan makhraj Anda secara detail.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="feature-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Waktu Fleksibel</h3>
        <p>Kebebasan menentukan jadwal belajar sendiri yang sesuai dengan rutinitas harian Anda.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="feature-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z"></path><path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Kurikulum Modern</h3>
        <p>Materi yang dirancang sistematis agar sangat mudah dipahami bahkan untuk tingkat pemula.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: transparent;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 70px auto;
  }

  .badge-mini {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    background: rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.08);
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }

  .text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--primary-cyan));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    padding: 45px 30px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.2);
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.05);
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    border-radius: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    transition: 0.4s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover .icon-box {
    background: var(--primary-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: rotate(5deg) scale(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.2);
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Animations */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .fade-up {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  /* Responsive Refinement */
  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .features-grid { gap: 20px; }
    h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -1px; }
    .features { padding: 100px 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); padding: 0 10px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container { padding: 0 20px; }
    h2 { font-size: 2.22rem; }
    .section-header { margin-bottom: 50px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .feature-card { padding: 40px 25px; text-align: center; align-items: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .icon-box { margin-bottom: 25px; }
    .features { padding: 80px 0; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  }
</style>
